    "description": "Solitaire Fish is a FREE and CREATIVE solitaire card game that takes you from card table to the deep sea. Enjoy the classic solitaire (also known as Patience ) gameplay, and you'll also get to build your unique aquarium by collecting a variety of sea creatures like the Clownfish, Blue Tang, Rainbowfish, Anglerfish, Butterflyfish, and Bannerfish. \r\n\r\nLove playing classic card games? Train your brain with our challenging solitaire games and decorate your own aquarium! Come and Try it NOW!\r\n\r\n- \ud83d\udc20 CREATIVE SOLITAIRE GAME\r\nWe've combined classic solitaire with captivating aquarium elements. Enjoy vibrant underwater scenes and adorable fish while playing!\r\n\r\n- \ud83c\udfa8 BEAUTIFUL GRAPHICS & SMOOTH GAMEPLAY\r\nOur goal is to create the best solitaire game. With beautiful HD graphics, simple controls, and smooth gameplay, you'll be able to play for hours on end!\r\n\r\n- \ud83c\udfc6 ADDICTIVE GOALS AND CHALLENGES\r\nEarn coins through gameplay to fill your aquarium with colorful fishes. Train your brain with daily challenges and discover more exciting activities in Solitaire Fish!\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Original and classic solitaire gameplay, fun and addictive.\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Winnable Deals: each game has at least one solution.\r\n\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Play Classic Solitaire draw 1 & draw 3 modes.\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Left-hand mode: more convenient for you.\r\n\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Single tap or drag & drop to move cards.\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Unlimited hints and undo, making solitaire even easier.\r\n\r\n\u2663\ufe0f Auto-save: continue the game anytime, anywhere.\r\n\u2663\ufe0f Play offline! No wifi required.\r\n\r\nIf you're a fan of card games like Freecell and Spider, then you'll surely fall in love with Solitaire Fish! It's an innovative twist on the classic solitaire game where you can also cultivate a vibrant aquarium.\r\n\r\nSolitaire Fish is not just a card game but also a relaxing journey through a colorful underwater world teeming with a variety of fishes to collect and nurture.\r\n\r\nSo, whether you're looking to challenge your brain with classic solitaire gameplay, kill some time, or delight in the tranquil ambience of your personalized aquarium, Solitaire Fish is the perfect game for you! Don't hesitate, dive into the Solitaire Fish experience NOW and revel in our world of classic card games and exquisite underwater life!\r\n\r\nWelcome to Solitaire Fish, the captivating fusion of classic solitaire and a delightful aquarium world!",
